to share the sex value as it was documented in a particular context.\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-lean-patient-gender-extension.html\">Patient Gender Extension</a></td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://lean.sa/fhir/lean/core/CodeSystem/lean-patient-gender-codesystem M}\">Male</span></td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
